Package: TraceSDTM
Type: Project
Title: Traceable Human-in-the-Loop SDTM Automation Demonstration
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("Jiacheng", "Xie", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xiecharlie2002@gmail.com")
Description: A local single-user browser workbench and reproducible demonstration of metadata profiling, three-stage
    constrained mapping recommendation, deterministic parameter injection,
    human approval, deterministic SDTM generation, frozen-specification ADSL and ADAE derivation,
    same-source summary tables, local validation, Pinnacle 21 Community validation, and multilevel lineage.
